{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Goofy Giraffe Game</strong> is an 3D platform game where we embody... a giraffe. But not just a giraffe ! A giraffe with a broken neck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The <i>Cube Rouge</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/fd5cad10fd7ed407cc22bf7c7e91885d.poster.avif?t=1757154535\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/fd5cad10fd7ed407cc22bf7c7e91885d.webm?t=1757154535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/fd5cad10fd7ed407cc22bf7c7e91885d.mp4?t=1757154535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;This giraffe will never escape from this bedroom ! She is too weak to go far !</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I just hope she won't find <strong>the spots</strong>, they could maybe help her to go higher...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And it jumps, and it bounces, again and again !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure with Softy, who wants to free herself and all the toys in the room from the evil Cube Rouge, who plans to enslave all the toys under his control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Softy is goofy\u00a0</strong>: She has short legs and a floppy neck, so she has to break her neck to jump really high. Weird, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/e67a5669fd126077d02af299319123aa.poster.avif?t=1757154535\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/e67a5669fd126077d02af299319123aa.webm?t=1757154535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/e67a5669fd126077d02af299319123aa.mp4?t=1757154535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own path</strong> : The evil Cube Rouge thief has stolen little Softy's spots. Don't you want to help her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/f2f1c99ace44b2f356516fac5ab481a1.poster.avif?t=1757154535\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/f2f1c99ace44b2f356516fac5ab481a1.webm?t=1757154535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/f2f1c99ace44b2f356516fac5ab481a1.mp4?t=1757154535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Softy is a big fan of carrots</strong> : Yum yum, Softy likes carrots. FIND THEM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/2c73be52d4b570433312d8ab07c86bfb.poster.avif?t=1757154535\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/2c73be52d4b570433312d8ab07c86bfb.webm?t=1757154535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr